{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1354857-storytellers-vault-kithbook-strega-is-now-live","id":1354857,"title":"[Storytellers Vault] Kithbook Strega is now live.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-13T23:09:46-08:00","id":1354857,"title":"[Storytellers Vault] Kithbook Strega is now live.","content":"I know I haven't been posting the previews over here, but 45 pages of witchy-owly goodness is finished and posted to the Storytellers Vault.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/297718/Kithbook-Strega?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/297718.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/297718/Kithbook-Strega?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\"> Kithbook Strega - White Wolf | Storytellers Vault </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/297718/Kithbook-Strega?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/297718/Kithbook-Strega?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Kithbook Strega - The Hidden Keepers of the Dark Wood No fairy tale is complete without a witch making an appearance, and so out of the a </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> The Hidden Keepers of the Deep Wood<br /> No fairy tale is complete without a witch making an appearance, and so out of the ancient Mediterranean come the Strega. Owl-like witches and warlocks who claim kinship with fabled Lilith, they have spread across the globe to claim and protect the hollows of the mystical Dark Wood that are their birthright. Their occult expertise and inborn ability to curse the unwary is sought by those brave enough to journey to their lairs at the edges of kithain society.<br /> <br /> After years of hiding in the shadows, the Strega are ready to divulge their secrets to you. Assuming you are prepared to pay the price for such dark and haunted knowledge.<br /> <br /> <br /> Kithbook: Strega features:<ul><li>The secret history of the Strega detailing their cyclical rise and fall over centuries.</li> <li>Advice and Insight into how the Strega organize themselves, and their deeply held beliefs and practices.</li> <li>Four player character archetypes ready for play, and a handful of notable Strega from across history.</li> <li>New Merits, Flaws, Treasures, and Chimera for Strega characters.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3670-spook359","name":"Spook359","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3670_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-14T14:14:09-08:00","id":1354920,"title":"","content":"Cool! I look forward to reading this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweat